{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57180","headline":"大乘赞十首 十 · 宝志","name":"大乘赞十首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悟解即是菩提，了本无有阶梯。\n堪叹凡夫躯偻，八十不能跋蹄。\n徒劳一生虚过，不觉日月迁移。\n向上看他师口，恰似失你孩儿。\n道俗峥嵘聚集，终日听他死语。\n不观己身无常，心行贪如狼虎。\n堪嗟二乘狭劣，要须摧伏六府。\n不食酒肉五辛，邪眼看他饮咀。\n更有邪行猖狂，修气不食盐醋。\n若悟上科至真，不假分别男女。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}